<title>NETHERLANDS: RABO SETS NLG 150 MLN EQUITY-LINKED DEAL FOR EBRD.</title>
<headline>RABO SETS NLG 150 MLN EQUITY-LINKED DEAL FOR EBRD.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rabo Securities NV said on</p>
<p>Tuesday it was launching a 150 million guilder zero coupon bond</p>
<p>for the European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD)</p>
<p>which would be linked to an index of shares in four Dutch</p>
<p>publishing and media companies.</p>
<p>Rabo said it was launching a product called the &quot;Dutch</p>
<p>Publishers Sprinter&quot; which combines an investment in the EBRD</p>
<p>bond with an investment in an index made up of shares in VNU</p>
<p>, Wolters Kluwer , PolyGram and</p>
<p>Elsevier .</p>
</text>
